Rampsmith was uninstalled
=========================

Rampsmith was uninstalled from Example Outfitters. It will delete the data
it holds for the store on October 19, 2026.

The remediation record is attached to this email as a CSV file: every fix,
its finding, its WCAG criterion, who approved it and when, and its
verification result. Keep this email if you need the record.

After that date Rampsmith cannot produce the record again.

